          {
            "md": "Your Tracy Mehause asked me if I could send to her copies of correspondence that I had with the Hawaiian Hotel and Restaurant Associations back in 1994, I duly sent her copies of what I had left in my files.",
            "value": "Your Tracy Mehause asked me if I could send to her copies of correspondence that I had with the Hawaiian Hotel and Restaurant Associations back in 1994, I duly sent her copies of what I had left in my files.",
            "bbox": [
              {
                "h": 82.44,
                "w": 771.96,
                "x": 131.83,
                "y": 609.81,
                "confidence": 0.8,
                "end_index": 206,
                "label": "text",
                "r": null,
                "start_index": 0
              }
            ],
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "md": "Tracy asked me if we had ever drafted a Bill concerning smoking/IAQ regulations for restaurants. I knew that we had helped draft Bills for IAQ proposals at the State Level. I also empathize with Tracy, unless you can offer an alternative proposal you usually lose out if you simply criticize proposals drawn-up by others, usually drafted by antis. For that reason I pulled out the latest \"Clean Air Act\" proposal we had worked on and tried to convert it into a Bill suitable for Restaurants. A copy is attached. Please critique it and if you think appropriate, circulate to your legal eagles. If you and they like it, or a modification of it we can pass it to Tracy. Alternatively, don't be shy in telling me to lose it!!!",
